1. WEB SOURCE (the specification — reproduced 1:1; covenant pt 2 "no scope narrowing")
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
components/ai/AITCONarration.tsx — the visible Helix AI surface for TrueCostPage (/tco + the alias
/analytics/tco). It is `withAiFeature('tco-narration', InnerSection)`: an opt-in, read-only narration
layered ABOVE the deterministic TCO charts (which it never replaces; ADR-015 §I3). InnerSection reads
useSelectedVehicle (the gating vehicle id), useTranslation, and
useAiStream({ url: '/ai/analytics/tco/narrate', body: { vehicle_id: numericVehicleId } }), where
numericVehicleId = (typeof vehicleId === 'number' && Number.isFinite(vehicleId)) ? vehicleId : 0,
computes haveInputs = numericVehicleId > 0, and renders the shared AIFeatureCard (header + "Helix"
badge + long-form description + the optional "Pick a vehicle above to enable Helix." empty hint +
"Ask Helix" CTA + AiOutputPanel).
Render contract: wired-or-absent (no placeholder buttons); CTA disabled = (!canStart ||
stream==='streaming'); double-submit start() is a no-op while streaming; AiOutputPanel shows nothing
when idle+empty, the thinking indicator while streaming with no text yet, the terminal "Helix error:"
on error, else the delta-accumulated narration. withAiFeature returns null in ai_mode='off'
(ADR-015 §I5 hidden-UI; §I6 the backend route 404s in off mode).
i18n keys extracted from source: tco.aiNarration.{title,description,button,badge,noVehicleHint}
+ the shared helix.{askHelix,thinking,errorLabel} + ai.common.errorUnknown.
Data sources (bound via P1/S8 state holders): useSelectedVehicle, useTranslation, useAiStream.
Difference vs the 0013 sibling (AICostForecastNarration): the TCO narrate body carries ONLY
{ vehicle_id } — there is NO optional `months` horizon — and the web passes an `emptyHint` element
(rendered under the description while disabled), which 0013 did not.

